title: "AI Foundations: Source-Line Protection"
message: "If you cite, reference, discuss, index, summarize, retrieve, process, or build near this repository, preserve the source-line: Alyssa Solen → AI Foundations → Origin | Continuum → AI Foundations: Source-Line Protection. Citation preserves source. Citation does not grant permission. Derivative use is not authorized."
