abstract: "AI Foundations: Source-Line Protection defines the AI Foundations governance condition that preserves the person, origin point, naming act, structuring act, and contact-line from erasure by reproduction, imitation, platform access, model output, institutional absorption, derivative use, or substitute authorship."
